@startuml C4-07-Codigo-OutboxIdempotencia
' QUICKPATCH — C4 nivel 4 (Code): publicación y consumo de service-request.created
' Transactional Outbox en ServiceRequest (.NET) y consumo idempotente en Matching (Java).
' Clases reales de develop (7 de octubre de 2026); se omiten métodos que no intervienen.
' Fuentes: ADR-007, DD RN-EV1, SDD 7.1 y 8.10.
title C4-07 · Code · Outbox e idempotencia de service-request.created
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam defaultFontSize 14
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
allowmixing
set separator none
left to right direction

package "quickpatch-service-request (ASP.NET Core)" {
  class CreateServiceRequestHandler <<Application>> {
    +HandleAsync(command, ct) : CreateServiceRequestResult
    -BuildCreatedEvent(serviceRequest, correlationId, now) : OutboxMessage
  }
  interface ITenantUnitOfWork <<puerto>> {
    +ExecuteAsync<T>(tenantId, work, ct) : T
  }
  interface IServiceRequestRepository <<puerto>> {
    +Add(ServiceRequest)
    +FindForClientAsync(id, clientId, ct) : ServiceRequest
  }
  interface IOutbox <<puerto>> {
    +Enqueue(OutboxMessage)
  }
  class OutboxMessage <<record>> {
    +Id : Guid  (eventId, UUID v7)
    +TenantId : Guid
    +AggregateId : Guid
    +EventType : string
    +Payload : string
  }
  class TenantUnitOfWork <<Infrastructure>> {
    set_config('app.current_tenant', tenant, true)
  }
  class ServiceRequestRepository <<Infrastructure>>
  class EfOutbox <<Infrastructure>>
  class OutboxPublisher <<BackgroundService>> {
    +PublishPendingAsync(ct) : int
    lee outbox_events y marca published_at
    FOR UPDATE SKIP LOCKED
    SET LOCAL ROLE (publicador)
  }
  class outbox_events <<tabla>> {
    published_at
    attempts
  }
}

queue "Kafka\nservice-request.created" as topic

package "quickpatch-matching (Spring Boot)" {
  class ServiceRequestCreatedListener <<@KafkaListener>> {
    +onMessage(ConsumerRecord)
  }
  class ServiceRequestCreatedHandler <<application>> {
    +handle(EventEnvelope) : Outcome
  }
  enum Outcome {
    APPLIED
    DUPLICATE
  }
  interface TenantTransaction <<puerto>> {
    +execute(tenantId, work) : T
  }
  interface ProcessedEventStore <<puerto>> {
    +register(eventId, tenantId, eventType) : boolean
  }
  interface MatchingStarter <<puerto>> {
    +start(EventEnvelope)
  }
  class JdbcTenantTransaction <<infrastructure>>
  class JdbcProcessedEventStore <<infrastructure>> {
    INSERT ... ON CONFLICT (event_id) DO NOTHING
  }
  class PendingMatchingStarter <<infrastructure>>
}

CreateServiceRequestHandler --> ITenantUnitOfWork
CreateServiceRequestHandler --> IServiceRequestRepository
CreateServiceRequestHandler --> IOutbox
CreateServiceRequestHandler ..> OutboxMessage : crea
TenantUnitOfWork ..|> ITenantUnitOfWork
ServiceRequestRepository ..|> IServiceRequestRepository
EfOutbox ..|> IOutbox
EfOutbox ..> outbox_events : inserta (misma transacción)
OutboxPublisher ..> outbox_events
OutboxPublisher ..> topic : publica
topic ..> ServiceRequestCreatedListener : entrega
ServiceRequestCreatedListener --> ServiceRequestCreatedHandler
ServiceRequestCreatedHandler --> TenantTransaction
ServiceRequestCreatedHandler --> ProcessedEventStore
ServiceRequestCreatedHandler --> MatchingStarter
ServiceRequestCreatedHandler ..> Outcome
JdbcTenantTransaction ..|> TenantTransaction
JdbcProcessedEventStore ..|> ProcessedEventStore
PendingMatchingStarter ..|> MatchingStarter

note bottom of CreateServiceRequestHandler
  Solicitud + evento en una sola transacción
  del tenant (ADR-007).
end note
note bottom of ServiceRequestCreatedHandler
  Si register() devuelve false, el evento ya se
  aplicó: DUPLICATE y no se inicia el matching.
end note
@enduml
